Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4.  Where next", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"59549da2-e712-46c4-b153-dc3f52a65a6d"],

Cell["\<\
The spatial diffusion-selection model, the SMC-ABC fit with its diagnostics, \
posterior predictive checks, held-out validation, prior sensitivity, the \
kriged maps, and the hero animation are all in \
community/ancient_dna_lactase_persistence.nb, built and evaluated by \
community/build_notebook.wls. The pipeline reruns end to end with \
scripts/run_pipeline.wls.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33bf5ad5-97d2-4c60-bd80-5c889d77f7cb"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
